BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1721 Tm (Extreme spread is the number most shooters quote. You measure from the outside of one hole to the outside of) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1809 Tm (the farthest hole and take off one bullet's width. It is easy to measure with a ruler, which is why it is everywhere.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1932 Tm (Its weakness is that it uses only two shots. The other shots could be anywhere inside without changing it. And) Tj ET
