BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2319 Tm (changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2442 Tm (At the range. One five-shot group with an extreme spread of one inch could come from a rifle that usually shoots) Tj ET
