BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3077 Tm (and more so the farther the target.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3200 Tm (No two cartridges leave the barrel at exactly the same speed. A slower bullet drops a little more on its way to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3288 Tm (target, a faster one a little less. At 100 yards the difference is small. At long range it can be the largest part of) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3376 Tm (your up and down spread, so a load with a small velocity SD matters more the farther you shoot.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3499 Tm (An SD from a few readings is as much at the mercy of luck as a group from a few shots, so it needs its range) Tj ET
